 "submission": {
  "summary": "P-2's oil rate drop in November 2018 was an operational choke cut from 70% to 40% after a 2-day shut-in on 2018-11-05, cutting weekly oil rate 41% from 786 Sm3/d to 463 Sm3/d; water cut stayed near 0.019, so it was not a reservoir or water breakthrough event.",
  "findings": [
   {
    "claim": "P-2 had a regime change on 2018-11-11 with weekly oil rate falling 41% across the event from 786 Sm3/d to 463 Sm3/d.",
    "detail": "detect_events E2: oil_rate shifts around 2018-11-11: weekly mean 1,426 -> 369 (-74%) long term; across change itself 4 weeks each side 786.42 -> 463.29 (-41%).",
