   {
    "claim": "Monthly oil rate fell from 785 Sm3/d in October 2018 to 512 Sm3/d in November 2018.",
    "detail": "production_monthly E3: 2018-10 oil_rate_per_producing_day 784.73 Sm3/d, bhp 203.33 bar, choke 70%; 2018-11 oil_rate 511.91 Sm3/d, bhp 224.39 bar, choke 44.29% (monthly avg), water_cut 0.01911.",
