   {
    "claim": "The drop followed a 2-day shut-in on 2018-11-05 to 2018-11-06 and a choke cut from 70% to 40% on 2018-11-07, with bottomhole pressure rising 21 bar from 203 bar to 224 bar.",
    "detail": "production_daily E5 shows 2018-11-05 and 2018-11-06 on_stream_hrs 0.0, choke 0.0, then 2018-11-07 choke 40.0 with oil 441.64 Sm3/d; E9 confirms only P-2 shut while P-1 and P-3 produced. Monthly bhp 203.33 -> 224.39 bar (+21.06 bar, E8).",
